DATABRICKS AUTO LOADER
- is a scalable & efficient way to ingest new files (like parquet, CSV, JSON) from cloud storage such as ADLS,
S3 into databricks in an incremental, streaming friendly way. 
- designed for large scale & conti arriving data.
- 

WHAT PROBLEM DOES AUTO LOADER SOLVE ?

W/O AUTO LOADER
--------------
- spark has to list all files in a dictionary
- re-scan folders repeatedly
- struggles with millions of files
- high metadata overhead + slow perf.

with AUTOLOADER
---------------
- only processess new files incrementally
- tracks state using checkpointing
- scales to millions/ billion of files efficiently

HOW IT WORKS ?
- you point it to a storage path (adls)
- it detects new files automatically
- it keeps track of processed files (via checkpoint)
- it loads only new data into spark. 

KEY FEATURES
- ince file processing
- scalable file discovery
- schema inference & evolution
- check pointing
- works with streaming + batch

